# Binaries Directory

Platform-specific Rust binaries are placed here during build.

## Binary Names

- `ex-g-se-linux` - Linux x64
- `ex-g-se-linux-arm64` - Linux ARM64
- `ex-g-se-macos-intel` - macOS x64
- `ex-g-se-macos-silicon` - macOS ARM64
- `ex-g-se-win.exe` - Windows x64
- `ex-g-se-win-arm64.exe` - Windows ARM64

Binaries are built from the Rust source and included in the npm package.
